OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly mist and fog patches in
OL,6,Frural spots steadily clear leaving a
OL,7,Fdry day for most with sunny spells.
OL,8,FLight winds for most, breezy in the
OL,9,Ffar southwest. Mild.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry night with variable
OL,12,Fcloud and clear spells, with mist and
OL,13,Ffog patches forming in inland rural
OL,14,Fspots. Breezy over high ground.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FEarly mist and fog clears
OL,17,Fleaving a bright and dry day for many
OL,18,Fwith light winds. Temperatures close
OL,19,Fto the average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
